/* ================================================================
   9M_detail.css  —  Deep Detail Panel Polish
   ================================================================
   Based on full source read of buildInfoCard + createSimpleEditCardContent:

   mushroomCard structure:
     infoCardGridItem (GridListItem wrapper)
       └─ infoCardTile mushroomCard (VBox)
            ├─ infoCardHeaderRow (HBox: title ↔ pinBtn)
            │    ├─ infoCardTitle (Text)
            │    └─ infoCardPinBtn (Button: pushpin-off/on)
            └─ [content by key]
                 datetime  → infoCardValue (read) | detailDateTimeGrid (edit)
                 equipment → infoCardValue | Input
                 location  → infoCardValue | detailLocationInput + locationCodeLabel
                 lpc       → infoCardValue | detailDictionarySelect
                 profession→ infoCardValue | detailDictionarySelect
                 observer  → detailSemanticMetaBlock
                              ├─ infoCardValue (fullname read)
                              ├─ detailPersonSuggestInput (edit)
                              ├─ createPrefixedStatus → PERNER/Position/Org unit
   
   Ch 1   mushroomCard — complete tile system
   Ch 2   infoCardTitle — card header label
   Ch 3   infoCardPinBtn — pushpin button
   Ch 4   infoCardValue — read state display
   Ch 5   detailSemanticMetaBlock — observer/inspected meta
   Ch 6   detailDateTimeGrid — edit mode date/time/timezone
   Ch 7   detailPersonSuggestInput — person search input
   Ch 8   detailDictionarySelect + detailLocationInput
   Ch 9   infoCardGrid layout — GridList sizing and gap
   Ch 10  infoCard focus + drag + animation
   Ch 11  Checks section — table + expandable rows
   Ch 12  detailSectionToolbar — section header bars
   Ch 13  Validation MessageStrip
   Ch 14  LockKilledBanner warning
   Ch 15  Attachment section
   Ch 16  Checks section empty state
   Ch 17  Complete dark/light/inverted coverage
   Ch 18  Final backdrop-filter kill
   ================================================================ */

